<title>USA: Russellville PPC, Ky., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Russellville PPC, Ky., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan said it won $1.255 million of Russellville Public Properties Corp., Ky., lease revenue bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.41 percent.</p>
</text>
